menu "Factory standard display"

config FACTORY_STANDARD_LCD_USE_TE
    bool "Synchronize framebuffer submission with external LCD TE"
    default n
    help
        Enable the JD9365 tearing-effect GPIO as an optional submission gate.
        The DSI Bridge VSYNC callback remains enabled and is still used to
        release LVGL after the submitted frame is consumed. If the TE signal
        is absent, the display path falls back after one frame period.

endmenu
